<title>USA: Wall Street stocks ease at opening.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks ease at opening.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks opened lower on Friday.</p>
<p>--Dow Industrials .DJI off six at 6919.</p>
<p>--Nasdaq Composite .IXIC off 1.69 at 1310.97.</p>
<p>--S&amp;P Index .SPX off 0.99 at 794.08.</p>
<p>--NYSE advance/decline .AD.N 179/297</p>
<p>--Nasdaq advance/decline .AD.O 569/736</p>
<p>--The 30-year long bond off 3/32 to yield 6.81 percent.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1737))</p>
